stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: submit (outbox written atomically)
  queued --> running: claim (lease + attempt++ = fencing token)
  queued --> cancelled: cancel
  running --> succeeded: complete (guarded by lease owner + token)
  running --> retry_scheduled: transient error or lease expired (reaper), attempts left
  running --> dead: permanent error or attempts exhausted
  running --> queued: graceful SIGTERM release (no attempt burned)
  running --> cancelled: cancel observed at heartbeat
  retry_scheduled --> queued: next_run_at reached (exponential backoff + jitter)
  retry_scheduled --> cancelled: cancel
  dead --> queued: replay
  succeeded --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
